    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0276" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/2031</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2238</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 10, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Supplementing the Legation’s despatch (No.
                    2160) of July 27 last, on the subject of the Kirin forestry loan, and referring
                    also to my telegram of August 22, 7 p.m. [6 p.m.], I have the honor to enclose
                    herewith a translation of the note (No. 834) of August 21, by which the Foreign
                    Office communicated the reply of the Ministry of Finance to my inquiry of July
                    27, and a copy of the further note (No. 832) which I addressed to the Foreign
                    Office on this subject on the 31st ultimo.</p>
                <p>I also enclose herewith a clipping from the Peking <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Leader</hi> of August 16,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d152-f1"/> reporting a mass
                    meeting held in Kirin for the discussion of measures with a view to the
                    cancelation of this loan agreement. In this connection, I take occasion to
                    enclose herewith a clipping from to-day’s issue of the Peking <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Leader</hi>,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d152-f2"/> giving the
                    substance of certain suggestions made by the provincial authorities of Kirin in
                    regard to the proposed amendment of certain terms of the agreement.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. V. A. MacMurray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d152-a1.xml" xpointer="d152-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d152-a2.xml" xpointer="d152-a2"/>
